# Commit Message Template
#
# Format: <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# <body>
#
# <footer>
#
# --- TYPES ---
# feat:     New feature
# fix:      Bug fix
# docs:     Documentation only
# style:    Formatting, no code change
# refactor: Code change, no feature/fix
# perf:     Performance improvement
# test:     Adding/updating tests
# build:    Build system changes
# ci:       CI configuration changes
# chore:    Maintenance tasks
#
# --- SCOPES ---
# core, memory, agents, api, quantum, benchmarks, tests, ci, docs
#
# --- RULES ---
# - Subject line: max 50 chars, imperative mood, no period
# - Body: wrap at 72 chars, explain WHAT and WHY
# - Footer: reference issues (Refs: #123, Fixes: #456)
#
# --- EXAMPLES ---
# feat(memory): add tiered compression for long-term storage
#
# Implements lossless compression using SVD-based basis vectors
# for long-term memory tier. This reduces storage requirements
# by approximately 10-100x while maintaining reconstruction fidelity.
#
# Why: Active memory capacity is limited; we need efficient
# long-term storage without losing information.
#
# Refs: #42
# ---
# fix(api): handle missing auth header gracefully
#
# Returns 401 Unauthorized instead of 500 Internal Server Error
# when Authorization header is missing from API requests.
#
# Fixes: #87
# ---
